        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sarah Chalke\n- TV Series: Scrubs, Roseanne, How I Met Your Mother, Rick and Morty, Maneater\n- Roles: Dr. Elliot Reid, Rebecca \"Becky\" Conner, Stella Zinman, Beth Smith\n- Topics: Nielsen ratings\n\nFacts:\n- From 1989 to 1990, Roseanne was the most watched television show in the United States and reached number one in the Nielsen ratings.\n- In 2009, Maneater was a television miniseries starring Sarah Chalke.\n- Sarah Chalke is known for portraying Dr. Elliot Reid on Scrubs.\n- Sarah Chalke is known for portraying the second Rebecca \"Becky\" Conner on Roseanne.\n- Sarah Chalke is known for portraying Stella Zinman on How I Met Your Mother.\n- Sarah Chalke is known for portraying Beth Smith on Rick and Morty.",
